  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>You can now parameterize a linked service in&nbsp;Azure Data Factory. When you create a&nbsp;linked service, select <strong>Add Dynamic Content</strong> under the property that you want to parameterize.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information, see the <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/parameterize-connections-to-your-data-stores-in-azure-data-factory/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blog post</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "You can now parameterize a linked service in Azure Data Factory. When you create a linked service, select Add Dynamic Content under the property that you want to parameterize.\n\nFor more information, see the blog post ."
  },
